msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3164c8335a488b59545c9939ec1edf0952ca4c232d1c5bf605c04b0b2eb1d3cb
#. default-sha256: 18d350eebc0fc511c71fe8f5e5af1b8f99b7ede9f42025da800b497b60b5a5ba
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it didn’t matter if it was all an illusion; ⟪k:1⟫the gentle breeze blowing in through "
"the window felt wonderful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫即便是幻想——⟪k:2⟫从窗外吹进来的舒适轻风……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c4849aaa41a16e67941b577585ce39f809bba9d5555ec31ec3d6c008d8f1cfc
#. default-sha256: ccb987492d58b8240ac0290f9cedf0000a43d5a7c6c7bd7cc0fb906198475648
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The smell of grass, the chirping of birds, the glistening blue sky...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was like a "
"thousand memories rushing back all at once,⟪k:3⟫and it brought tears to my eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫草丛的清香，⟪k:1⟫鸟儿的鸣叫，⟪k:2⟫明亮的蓝天……这一切都让我感到怀念。⟪k:3⟫我不禁，⟪k:4⟫流下了"
"泪水。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e22dbc9109687d55b29605d7b7b1df21b48f20d34ec2bcddfd6f2d5dae188ee3
#. default-sha256: 47f886205c5e235389dd46a81bbd59da8fc7650392045195dac7f022585d37bd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as she always did, the witch’s voice crushed my elation,⟪k:1⟫dragging me back to reality."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——粉碎我的感动、⟪k:1⟫将我拉回现实的，⟪k:2⟫依旧是魔女那熟悉的声音。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d9321eed42f1f8f01aedd5b1d4dd32187c90938697709f3c311f732948a210c
#. default-sha256: 4bd05dee4c7b972c69a8b2a8d98f8b619dad61cd50844ad988ea23d40911dcd0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was that moment that began my true decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫才是我真正堕落的开端。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab238a9f7ebb7c3d987cf436cf0d69a5f0639ed25770b0c68a6aae8d8ca61e09
#. default-sha256: 444ff4c5e4880e1455ce76bebc0b7b485dbe32f90d012a6da7f868443ee7607f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Have you already forgotten?⟪k:1⟫Oh, good heavens... ⟪k:2⟫Do you have your head on straight, "
"my dear?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你忘记了？⟪k:1⟫哎呀，真是的……你的大脑真的在运转吗？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95bf40239d19c3ec7658832ae25a8bd375defb4016f207a8951d8c8325362f33
#. default-sha256: e86fa6442c2853669c971d1d711f4d74abab6d33044db71fd65867ae9fd3cac1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...It looks like someone’s here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这只不过是事先的准备。⟪k:1⟫……好了，⟪k:2⟫好像有人来了哦？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_5ECC5EC6_1C2A_4C00_8926_9D15828AFB8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
