msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫(The bar has been removed...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫（……门栓被拉开了……）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc5a62e039bc0089f47082af06e8046eecd205b7d99fe03315530a2a95dcc4f5
#. default-sha256: 7e87072a0cfad017c2dbaa031aa0294a2800721b8266a75d623449679ee5dc96
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫…………"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fa8266e0e4f799f02e1c07fd5f268d6011b3894b8b100dfc1e63cb0da3e6b9c
#. default-sha256: 31ef0cb2a5ebfad606e4b1b434087200d5241fd15830e2aaa2a440c9fadd1475
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had stepped into Heaven on Earth.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know it sounds melodramatic, so "
"please don’t laugh."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在我眼里，⟪k:1⟫这个景色犹如人间乐园。⟪k:2⟫请不要嘲笑我这太过夸张的反应。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ec39f847054995307f48e0d8d32a5df1dc42e1907ba678f164881c51d2bb119
#. default-sha256: 5a2d721058bad86c95d09235fb610087982ff8a809cc4d6bbfae94043eb1596e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wondered where I was, of course, but I neither shouted nor jumped in surprise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我自然疑惑这里究竟是哪，⟪k:2⟫但没有大惊小怪——"

#: scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfb8ae28490d0d3b68897cb1a2db9d4f90bb945ef6cec6917619f273488f4d5a
#. default-sha256: 614f83eb7404b5adc97fb6edde55e102b7576b67df16ca7c7c9b2e4daf7e5902
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instead, I found myself accepting of my circumstances, as unnatural as they might have been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我已在尽力接受这不合常理的事态。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8abaf6c6fa8910a5fe468dd5d56866f722f2f9fd726d65c8e002aff5a6b2124b
#. default-sha256: 6da08cf24ff41ff9b1cb75aca07d2c5fa0fa632c864a3ce8c2dc1b61287582b2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫gad⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫could this road be any bloody worse?⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫It’s in dire need of paving, on top of everything else..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫哎呀呀……路况太糟了，简直没法走呀。⟪k:4⟫看来，⟪k:5⟫要先铺装好道路才行……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab1d239c8f38e451a32c6847e7a0d809f01abe1b618198fc763f42aac06642e9
#. default-sha256: ef5bcc4afecc45ea5d7b231201c47a8f0269b837a865924fb2e5f085201bf814
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He’s speaking a different language...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（语言不一样………）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f668bb9540fdef289d8e07f22959582d12a9f191b2526ef45af5b259a852ab19
#. default-sha256: 8a72606081a487361e0f01ba978fc94d5825e4e25b9fccdd89bc39c60fe9447e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The middle-aged man approached me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his attire and the way he held himself,⟪k:3⟫"
"he appeared to be upper-class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一位老年男性走到我身边，⟪k:1⟫这样问道。⟪k:2⟫从他的形言举止上可以看出，⟪k:3⟫身份应该很高贵。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db198b34d2bab86f77be918d2c63f50eb68d77ff9adef6ba42ab74e8991aacb2
#. default-sha256: f4b8956cce9eea0fc3105f358883016deaead8ee7a0bbd28861011359069d1e6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the words coming out of his mouth were not in the language I had grown up speaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是从他嘴里说出来的话，⟪k:1⟫跟我听惯的语言有点不一样。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95c81577651f46b567c5d4c035b3937f111ff49878c69abce2b87c672af16d07
#. default-sha256: 457e48cd6583b08a1abad6bfe7814d847403184364aff1d705126c26d1cc57fb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I stood there staring at him absentmindedly, the more incredulous he became."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫看我呆站了一会儿还不回话，⟪k:1⟫那位老年男性视线里怀疑的眼色渐浓。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 400f53c8390eda0c5abb088259d87bdfd35ee3c02e8b5ddc6a84841e607b8919
#. default-sha256: 7e5b86c3c50201091159c06e655b47fd9d4ad7b37c78b563f2a404d2a25e7e3a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fortunately, I suppose, I was able to understand bits and pieces of what he had said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫幸运的是，⟪k:1⟫我可以听懂他的一些话。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d01c60e5b23d682381e432f51d9108500bfd10be833fa1e8c70b51fe6442c7b6
#. default-sha256: 9a66fd89387c9af57ec61f207ab92675602a1824a4092d9b285e81dd54c1a2e2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As merchants in the capital, my family did business with people from other countries, and as "
"a result, I had learned a handful of words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫嗯，⟪k:1⟫毕竟我家是在首都做生意的，⟪k:2⟫跟异邦人有过交流。⟪k:3⟫在那时学了不少异邦的语言。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beb1e454e9bb2be3b60cf944e2abc3c60447687f50a776e97549bb0d601bcb1f
#. default-sha256: da0eb236dcbdd2d1888d2334c4eea2a6271972cbffbf9f9fd36fb37ac1083e89
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The problem was... ⟪k:1⟫it had been so long ago, I had no confidence whatsoever in my "
"ability to hold a conversation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只是，⟪k:1⟫这是很久以前的事了……⟪k:2⟫能否顺利进行交流，⟪k:3⟫我还真是一点自信都没有。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64f27aaf4fd8cbc426296b1f206fd38c33594dcd1ca6e96d83f28d004229b779
#. default-sha256: d4488fca9e29889d2e7075721353387945a2cda630e759ffd372b1acda19c89c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am... ⟪k:3⟫I am a servant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我……⟪k:1⟫我是……⟪k:2⟫这个屋子的佣人……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3f415133775673e214500ea8a716e8f3dec01f483a26570515d5cc7e4bf0b2c
#. default-sha256: 2246670c9176fb7ff7fd3e54544403b04d0c64484ad3361c3ae85ab1e1f76d43
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You weren’t informed?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bloody hell. Off to a great start, I see.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Well, "
"what can you do, I guess..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……你没收到书信吗？⟪k:1⟫真伤脑筋啊。⟪k:2⟫唉，⟪k:3⟫没办法……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f71b7320666aa12d9c15f71efce57ce446c1a7903d1a36c3db01f9d8ab2e848e
#. default-sha256: 0c1439dfe11477e7a69fc4dbebd8c805d9a0ffae4b1c4b87304a89235dde668f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was also the first person I served under as the Maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫并且，⟪k:1⟫是从我成为馆中女仆之后，⟪k:2⟫第一位侍奉的人。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1aa4873b9bc1c7a59d4324698c5eb56e422f641fa8e209eeec2a278f2a5561ad
#. default-sha256: d7aace472244dd3e727099cabb7850a25403e6477dfa6a6b492897f1419fcdcb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3"
msgid ""
