#: scenario6:scenario6_AA6DD54B_D864_41CD_A245_474E7EFA4644
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 933ecdce401b1c4bcf8f5689e3e2273e3c1cdbf657527fb58b1fbde1cc52fbe7
