msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that time, the mansion underwent a number of decor changes, as Hayden brought in "
"sculptors to work on different areas of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这馆经过了两年的时间，⟪k:1⟫面貌跟以前大不一样了。⟪k:2⟫海登时不时地从镇上唤来雕刻师之类的人，"
"⟪k:3⟫大刀阔斧地对洋馆进行整顿。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0A84EEF8_E0B4_478D_B500_D7EC3B50E9A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b01029a79959a5f816ad20175bb3a0fe034c8872ed32a2b4382daa12d8166ad2
